{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And of the precious things of the produce of the sun.</b> That his land was open to the sun and sweetened the fruits (Sifrei)." "<b>The precious things put forth by the moons.</b> There are fruits that the moon ripens, and these are cucumbers and gourds. Another interpretation — <b>The precious things put forth by the moons.</b> That the earth puts forth and brings forth from month to month."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:43.115546976Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}